  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Lōo-giō ê露水"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>崎仔頭赤子</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭若出門&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lōo-giō面頂ê璇石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Liam-mi就拍無--去--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明仔載　透早</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊猶原koh金siak-siak&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê露水</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē-tàng tùn-tenn偌久</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明仔載ê露水--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊kám koh ē生tńg--來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mài食蒜頭吐lōo-giō</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">等mi̍h oh到　凊彩豆腐</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">等人快老　樂暢過日</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若án-ne生　逐日</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規工規面金siak-siak</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2-xo52rAetlF6tBYvCrhLBrvg36d9z94Eo-_KHWKLXnqbpd283Ny_0IeTxKmVqr0la90IRySA-wuBslHFqrhYMfqIpMxhT_pZFcl_wQSCSOFOn3JRjJ_N0HaLG7cc_H6Cd3J1nykEKk68cmpk-reWaEn9Nyd-g5gf6skc5h4nzdHVzkEZSWUX7BiAkw/s2847/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2847\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/